	(text_box "The I2C Address Rule\n\nWhen you are using the I2C protocol, \nthe chip reads the voltage level of the SDO pin to \nestablish its identifier on the bus:\n\nSDO tied to Ground (VSSIO): The I2C address becomes 0x46.\nSDO tied to Power (VDDIO): The I2C address becomes 0x47"
